/*
   Localizable.strings (en) — the product's own voice.

   English is the source language, not a translation: it is written the way a macOS developer
   writes it, following Apple's conventions (System Settings, not Preferences; Title Case in
   menus; short imperatives on buttons). The French file is the translation, and it must carry
   exactly the same keys — `CatalogueDeChainesTests` fails otherwise.

   Vocabulary is fixed by landing/messages/en.json and README.md: notch, notch app, switch,
   hide, relaunch, on stage. Do not invent a second one.
*/

